{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "57c30268bee399a29d021679d8ef36be3b1bf1122a0158aabe9c6fb6181bc34a", "ja": "（劇場のクリスマス公演が、もうじき始まる。\nが、麗花の姿が見えない……どこに行ったんだ？）", "zh": "（剧场的圣诞公演就快开始了。\n不过，却没看见丽花的人影……她跑哪去了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b056c13c1c1e486f73006d5a8b85d699b85d42b7d8552c039224637c0e0defa6", "ja": "あとは……屋上だけだな。", "zh": "接下来……只剩下屋顶而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "8642bccd4acb2093be3f7bb46700bfd7934e75a48ec7fda1188de8ddc776dcf6", "ja": "ふぅ～……。", "zh": "呼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e2366b214830127259d38ffbd75e73030e78f4d7735f2da54cd4d9b7a2ecf0c6", "ja": "麗花！\n本当に、こんなところにいたのか……。", "zh": "丽花！\n原来你真的在这里啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "b79dfa48f1ebf3d300677e6f831f101abd18fb17b0a17a2ffd5246052f84ff91", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nぱんぱかぱーん！　ようこそ屋上へ、二番乗りです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n锵锵锵锵～！欢迎来到屋顶上，你是第二名！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "b83b57b7d19d8084bee761bc21324b705d2786bc1cfd1a6070715c3b9dc4bc7a", "ja": "見てください、雪が降ってきましたよ！\nホワイトクリスマスライブ、ですね♪", "zh": "你看，开始下雪了耶！\n今天是白色圣诞演唱会呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "8f003fd7b83d8647c90eac4feca276058290b28fdc6610877fc7fff25446a98c", "ja": "ところで{$P$}さんは、どうして\n屋上に？　もしかして、サンタさん探しですか？", "zh": "话说回来，{$P$}先生\n为什么会到屋顶上？难不成是来找圣诞老人的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "901dae9270a1f3b263e2cd57a045b7406c80d7483ebd8e11c64525c150a91c19", "ja": "そうだな、麗花サンタ探しだよ。\nそろそろ本番だから、準備しよう。", "zh": "你说得没错，我在找丽花圣诞老人。\n差不多要正式开始了，准备一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "f237d5fd277484242fe0c9371353287b6674d7a6d5e0d7d23339e073dabe52a9", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい！\nもうそんな時間だったんだ。すぐ戻りますね！", "zh": "啊，对不起！\n原来已经这么晚了，我这就回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b1fc18e83cd7262e2406fdbb502c8c5a43b3607f910846044bc650e983f0117a", "ja": "麗花は？\nここでサンタさんを待ってたのか？", "zh": "倒是丽花，\n你刚刚是在这里等圣诞老人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "72a1eed72a7e9d2a3cab8182bf2bb2642bfa2aa384cb577f513bf7f7ac65d13e", "ja": "ふふっ、そうなんです。実は私、小さいころ\nサンタさんに会ったことがあるんですよ！", "zh": "呵呵，没错。\n其实我小时候有见过圣诞老人喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3b7607ef8a5a4991a8adae616017d4e345060a1eba332c436e8f280757b53057", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "90ec19d57240a202f26c669e8786cab6b5d1521bac852b65f319bfedbb34c4d0", "ja": "はい！　その時に会ったサンタさん、\n私のお父さんにソックリだったんです！", "zh": "没错！当时见到的圣诞老人，\n跟我爸爸长得一模一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "b0d349487c939a900b28d94bf5f38ff49da1e9433b9a6a72a56bbf0ae797def2", "ja": "私がビックリして「お父さん、サンタさんだったの？」\nって聞いたら、「よく似てるって言われるんだ」って。", "zh": "我吓了一跳，问他说「原来爸爸是圣诞老人吗？」，\n结果他说「常常有人说我们长得很像」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "9a57c69165a299f4fd10e7dfddb366a6a0fd04d1655d5353eb71e5f109529424", "ja": "あれからずっと、お父さんソックリなサンタさんに、\nまた会えないかな～って思ってるんですけど……。", "zh": "自从那次以后我一直在想，有没有机会再见到\n那位跟爸爸长得一模一样的圣诞老人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1198e86928547dd7305cc0f53e2e1d9a7706317075e8f1d8cb1384975b8b13ce", "ja": "そうだったのか。いいお父さん……じゃなくて、\nいいサンタさんだったんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊，那他真是位好爸……不对，\n真是位好圣诞老人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "33461fa68b6ac0abe39748ce07f26453f77be6c3ada54dcfb3a0ac67e02bc5cf", "ja": "はい。でも、ずーっと待ってるのに、\nなかなか会えないんですよ。忙しいのかな～。", "zh": "对啊，不过就算我再怎么等，\n却一直见不到他。他是不是很忙呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4d0b824905b6939c98b4a2637a0e38ca878c1238a04a0f642a8535bbba93146e", "ja": "そうだな……クリスマスは、サンタさんにとっても\nかきいれ時だろうし、忙しいのかもな。", "zh": "这个嘛……毕竟圣诞节对圣诞老人来说\n是一年中最繁忙的时候，大概是真的很忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "b27c1f5a45a5caa2ba0b6913c7d0c893f11bcf6c8826db78f2097d40998d9c3f", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかもしれませんね！　サンタさんには\n会えなかったけど、今日は待っててよかったです。", "zh": "呵呵，或许是这样也说不定！\n虽然今天没见到圣诞老人，但还好我有上来这里等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "d0f6c3b27d278997e0a62922615be8c692d5c390f4518f5d68c082d32207773b", "ja": "その代わり、とっても普通でとっても素敵な\nトナデューサーさんに会えましたから♪", "zh": "因为即使圣诞老人没来，\n我还是见到了既普通又出色的驯鹿制作人先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "67c2a572f333f32c9606f25ee16100b593074ad96547bf83e40306cb8398fc2e", "ja": "それじゃ、そろそろステージに向かいましょうか。\nナビ、よろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "那么，我们差不多该去舞台那里了吧。\n麻烦你带路啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f61951b4ac47047cd4c76f2e9a52f10271e9f4df0f7019ee5d7f12681118b9cf", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nみんなが待ってる。急ごう！", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n大家都在等我们，赶快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0084_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "787250310d295c0c9b2f72cdc321282d7b4d39781f15b19317a59dde8ea70351", "ja": "はーい！　いけいけ、ゴーゴー♪", "zh": "好的──！走吧走吧GO GO♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
